Chapter: DerivingEq
  cites Foreword chapter Console
  cites Codex chapter General

 `deriving Eq` generates structural equality: same constructor with
 equal fields (recursively) compares equal.

Section: Types

  Color = | Red | Green | Blue  deriving Eq

  Wrap = | Wrap (Integer)  deriving Eq

  Point = record { x : Integer, y : Integer }  deriving Eq

Section: Opening

  opening : [Console] Nothing = act
    print-line-uni (show (Red == Red))
    print-line-uni (show (Red == Blue))
    print-line-uni (show (Wrap 5 == Wrap 5))
    print-line-uni (show (Wrap 5 == Wrap 6))
    print-line-uni (show (Point { x = 1, y = 2 } == Point { x = 1, y = 2 }))
    print-line-uni (show (Point { x = 1, y = 2 } == Point { x = 1, y = 9 }))
  end

